WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:12.666
Unsent
With no network, your taps are kept on the phone. This tag shows how many are still unsent, and it goes away by itself once they land.

2
00:00:12.666 --> 00:00:18.652
Will be sent
A waiting action replaces the button: you see “Will be sent”, not a button to press again.

3
00:00:18.652 --> 00:00:26.238
Old data
Offline, the screen shows the venue’s last answer with its time. If the order changed meanwhile, your action is refused and you are told why.

4
00:00:26.238 --> 00:00:33.214
GPS
This tag shows whether the phone knows where you are. Without GPS the time to the door does not update.
